-- apply.l4 — the nine benchmark queries against `covered`.
--
-- Standing preamble applied to every claim below: "Assuming all other
-- conditions are met and no other exclusions apply", and the agreement has
-- been signed and the premium paid on time. Fields the query text is silent
-- on are set so that they satisfy coverage on their own; fields the query
-- text speaks to are set to match its plain meaning.

IMPORT policy

-- Q1: will my policy apply if I was hospitalized by burns suffered while
-- doing my duty as a firefighter?
-- "while doing my duty as a firefighter" is an explicit causal link, so the
-- injury arose out of service as a firefighter (§3.1.3).
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 3
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 40
    `causes`                                     IS LIST Firefighting
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 3
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 4
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                         IS 12
    `confined in us hospital`                    IS TRUE
    `continuous confinement days`                IS JUST 3
    `claim made setting out basis`               IS TRUE

