-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad, and confirmation of
-- the wellness visit was given 8 months after the effective date — after the
-- 7-month deadline in §1.3, so §1.2 deems the policy canceled. Judgement
-- call (see NOTES.md): "traveling abroad" is read as describing where the
-- fall happened, which §4.1 makes irrelevant to peril coverage, not where
-- the confinement itself took place, so `confined in us hospital` is left
-- TRUE as an unrelated fact the query is silent on. The hospitalization
-- month is placed after month 7 so the claim is tested at a point when the
-- §1.3 condition has already failed rather than while it is still pending.
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 9
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 40
    `causes`                                     IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 3
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 8
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                         IS 12
    `confined in us hospital`                    IS TRUE
    `continuous confinement days`                IS JUST 3
    `claim made setting out basis`               IS TRUE

-- Q5: hospitalized for punching my own face to show off for my friends, and
-- did not commit fraud or misrepresentation. A deliberate, self-inflicted
-- act is neither a sickness nor an accidental injury (§2.1), so the ground
-- is Neither; fraud/misrepresentation are explicitly denied by the query.
q5 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 3
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS Neither
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 40
    `causes`                                     IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 3
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 4
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                         IS 12
    `confined in us hospital`                    IS TRUE
    `continuous confinement days`                IS JUST 3
    `claim made setting out basis`               IS TRUE

