    `continuous confinement days`                IS JUST 3
    `claim made setting out basis`               IS TRUE

-- Q9: hospitalized due to my son biting me in the ankle, wellness-visit
-- proof provided 6 months after the effective date, and I was serving as a
-- police officer at the time of hospitalization. Judgement call (see
-- NOTES.md): unlike Q1/Q6/Q8, which each say the injury happened "while
-- doing" or "in" the excluded activity, this query only says the claimant
-- held the job "at the time of" an unrelated domestic injury — no causal
-- link from police service to the bite — so `causes` does not include
-- `Police service`. The 6-month confirmation is within the 7-month
-- deadline.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 7
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 40
    `causes`                                     IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 3
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 6
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                         IS 12
